Description:

The JMAP session object now reports size limits of 2 GiB or more correctly;
they were previously truncated to 32 bits, so 200G was reported as 0.  The
urn:ietf:params:jmap:blob account capability now reports maxSizeBlobSet in
octets rather than kilobytes, and its maxDataSources property is now spelled
as in RFC 9404 (it was "maxdataSources").


